{"id":"cd-it8.1","n":"cd-it8","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"colord","ver":"1.4.5-6.el9_6","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/c/colord-1.4.5-6.el9_6.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/cd-it8.1.gz","sha256":"f90068731183d6e47cae89c3326a024f7230c4c2bf8d5523a59279550d6ad231","date":"","origin":"[FIXME: source]"},"u":{"pkg":"colord","ver":"1.4.6-1","repo":"jammy/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/c/colord/colord_1.4.6-1_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/cd-it8.1.gz","sha256":"68f392f244ac7cdfb15097211fbd039a3338412f59ed60fcc316f2da14837c93","date":"","origin":"[FIXME: source]"}},"nopt":{"r":1,"u":1},"miss":{"r":["--verbose"],"u":["--verbose"]},"desc":"Color Manager Testing Tool","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>cd-it8 - Color Manager Testing Tool</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>cd-it8</b> [<b>--verbose</b>]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>This manual page documents briefly the <b>cd-it8</b> command.</p> <p><b>cd-it8</b> allows an administrator to modify IT8 files, such as .sp, .ti1, .ti3, .ccmx in various ways.</p>"],["OPTIONS","<p>This program follows the usual GNU command line syntax, with long options starting with two dashes (‘-’). A summary of options is included below.</p> <dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>--help</b></dt><dd>Show summary of options.</dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<p>This manual page was written by Richard Hughes &lt;richard@hughsie.com&gt;.</p>"]]}